<title>USA: Rotterdam-Mohonasen CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</title>
<headline>Rotterdam-Mohonasen CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc., said it won $2.730 million of Rotterdam-Mohonasen Central Sch Dist, N.Y., general obligation school district bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.58 percent.</p>
</text>
